    "body": "Since we bumped to python 3.12, `setuptools` is no longer provided by default: https://docs.python.org/3.12/whatsnew/3.12.html#ensurepip Declare this explicitly.\r\n\r\nAlso bypass `certvalidator`'s custom test loader using `unittest`, until [this upstream patch](https://github.com/LRGH/elfesteem/commit/000d6bbcd3a4b3d132ad6d932eedb3158b3313e9)  makes it into our Guix time machine commit.\r\n\r\nCommits split to allow easy reversion of only the `imp` test loader patch.\r\n\r\nFixes: #36421",
