      "message": "guix: declare python-setuptools\n\nSince we bumpted to python 3.12, setuptools is no longer provided by\ndefault:\n\nhttps://docs.python.org/3.12/whatsnew/3.12.html#ensurepip\n\n> easy_install, pkg_resources, setuptools and distutils are no longer\n> provided by default in environments created with venv or bootstrapped\n> with ensurepip, since they are part of the setuptools package. For\n> projects relying on these at runtime, the setuptools project should be\n> declared as a dependency and installed separately (typically, using\n> pip).",
