          "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/11977b42acc54e2abcd8e06272a8f44865cf40a4"
        }
      ],
      "message": "guix: bypass certvalidator's legacy test loader\n\nGuix now uses Python 3.12, which removed the imp module.\n\nCertvalidator's custom test runner imports imp and fails before running\nany tests, preventing the macOS codesigning environment from building.\n\nUse unittest discovery to run the existing suite and remove the unused\nimp import from its package initializer. Keep the existing test skips.\n\nThis workaround can be removed when the certvalidator source has a test\nloader compatible with Python 3.12.\n\nSplit from the previous commit to allow easy reversion in the future\nwhen upstream changes flow down.",
